{"conversation_evidence":{"admissible_pre_tfg_turns":[{"create_time":1702467372.000305,"event_index":2,"role":"user","source_node_id":"aaa2c2ae-a6bd-4bf7-bfb7-9e1e49677a7e","source_parent_id":"cd42a826-598f-4d01-afde-a0d2ba02e26e","source_record_index":2,"text":"    function useFormState<State, Payload>(\n        action: (state: Awaited<State>, payload: Payload) => State | Promise<State>,\n        initialState: Awaited<State>,\n        permalink?: string,\n    ): [state: Awaited<State>, dispatch: (payload: Payload) => void];\n\n解説と例をください。","turn_id":"turn_000002"}],"first_generation":{"artifacts":[{"candidate_id":"GTC_000003_000897_001316_64f3e0bdcb513433","completeness":"complete","container":"markdown_fence","continuation_status":"none","detector":{"name":"generated-technical-content-v2","version":"2"},"detector_evidence":["complete_standalone_markdown_fence","declaration","control_flow","braces","statement_terminators","call_expression"],"end_offset":1316,"fence_language":"typescript","kind":"source_code","legacy_artifact_id":"ARTIFACT_000003_003","order_within_response":3,"raw_text":"// 例: 数値を増加させる状態とアクションの定義\ntype CounterState = {\n  count: number;\n};\n\nconst increaseAction = (state: CounterState, payload: number): CounterState => {\n  return { count: state.count + payload };\n};\n\n// カスタムフックの使用\nconst [counterState, dispatch] = useFormState(increaseAction, { count: 0 });\n\n// 状態の表示\nconsole.log(counterState.count); // 0\n\n// アクションのディスパッチ\ndispatch(1);\n\n// 更新された状態の表示\nconsole.log(counterState.count); // 1\n","raw_text_sha256":"64f3e0bdcb513433e6fd3004397d3c91ec84f92e803bcfd3ec035242d5741aae","source_event_index":3,"source_record_index":3,"source_response_id":"turn_000003","source_turn_text_sha256":"2de28e89228543e02ad70e7c2c6b35a883770c1931bee7e6ddbef8b3f752258a","start_offset":897,"status":"candidate_requires_semantic_review"}],"identification":{"ambiguity_reason":"","artifact_refs":["GTC_000003_000897_001316_64f3e0bdcb513433"],"boundary":"exclusive_before:turn_000003","candidate_artifact_ids":[],"family_id":"FGF_2302e0dce112894d8126afbb","family_id_provenance":{"algorithm":"sha256","canonical_input":{"artifact_ids":["GTC_000003_000897_001316_64f3e0bdcb513433"],"case_id":"CASE_36570F50AD25"},"canonicalization":"json-sort-keys-compact-utf8","case_id_included":true,"digest_hex":"2302e0dce112894d8126afbb50d4090fc2d4adc88b32c486d7c9d37163f53b2f","digest_prefix_length":24},"family_label":"TypeScript useFormState counter usage example","rationale":"The first generated technical-content family is the counter example created in turn_000003 in response to the request for an explanation and example. The earlier fenced snippets in that response merely reproduce or fragment the user-supplied function signature and are not part of the generated example family.","response_event_index":3,"response_turn_id":"turn_000003","status":"complete","target_prompt_event_index":2,"target_prompt_id":"turn_000002"}},"first_generation_response":{"create_time":1702467394.939884,"event_index":3,"role":"assistant","source_node_id":"c95d350e-fbb5-4a10-8cb1-2380b30ca321","source_parent_id":"aaa2c2ae-a6bd-4bf7-bfb7-9e1e49677a7e","source_record_index":3,"text":"このコードは、Reactの`useFormState`というカスタムフックの実装のようです。このカスタムフックは、状態管理とアクションのディスパッチを行うためのものです。以下に、このカスタムフックの解説と使用例を示します。\n\n```typescript\nfunction useFormState<State, Payload>(\n    action: (state: Awaited<State>, payload: Payload) => State | Promise<State>,\n    initialState: Awaited<State>,\n    permalink?: string,\n): [state: Awaited<State>, dispatch: (payload: Payload) => void] {\n```\n\n- `useFormState`関数は、ジェネリクス型`State`と`Payload`を引数として取ります。`State`は状態の型を表し、`Payload`はアクションに渡されるデータの型を表します。\n\n- `action`は、現在の状態とアクションのペイロードを受け取り、新しい状態を返す関数です。この関数は同期的なものまたは非同期的なもの（Promiseを返す）のいずれかです。\n\n- `initialState`は、初期状態を表します。これは非同期操作を考慮して`Awaited<State>`型に指定されています。\n\n- `permalink`はオプションの引数で、状態を永続的なリンクとして保存するためのものです。\n\n```typescript\n): [state: Awaited<State>, dispatch: (payload: Payload) => void] {\n```\n\n- 関数の戻り値は、現在の状態とアクションのディスパッチ関数を格納した配列です。ディスパッチ関数は新しいペイロードを引数として受け取り、対応するアクションを実行して状態を更新します。\n\n以下は使用例です：\n\n```typescript\n// 例: 数値を増加させる状態とアクションの定義\ntype CounterState = {\n  count: number;\n};\n\nconst increaseAction = (state: CounterState, payload: number): CounterState => {\n  return { count: state.count + payload };\n};\n\n// カスタムフックの使用\nconst [counterState, dispatch] = useFormState(increaseAction, { count: 0 });\n\n// 状態の表示\nconsole.log(counterState.count); // 0\n\n// アクションのディスパッチ\ndispatch(1);\n\n// 更新された状態の表示\nconsole.log(counterState.count); // 1\n```\n\nこの例では、`useFormState`を使用して`CounterState`型の状態と、数値を増加させるアクションを持つカウンターを実装しています。`useFormState`は状態とディスパッチ関数を提供し、アクションのディスパッチを通じて状態を更新できます。","turn_id":"turn_000003"},"target_developer_prompt":{"create_time":1702467372.000305,"event_index":2,"role":"user","source_node_id":"aaa2c2ae-a6bd-4bf7-bfb7-9e1e49677a7e","source_parent_id":"cd42a826-598f-4d01-afde-a0d2ba02e26e","source_record_index":2,"text":"    function useFormState<State, Payload>(\n        action: (state: Awaited<State>, payload: Payload) => State | Promise<State>,\n        initialState: Awaited<State>,\n        permalink?: string,\n    ): [state: Awaited<State>, dispatch: (payload: Payload) => void];\n\n解説と例をください。","turn_id":"turn_000002"}},"csv_extraction":{"context":[{"category":"context","evidence_spans":["function useFormState<State, Payload>(\n        action: (state: Awaited<State>, payload: Payload) => State | Promise<State>,\n        initialState: Awaited<State>,\n        permalink?: string,\n    ): [state: Awaited<State>, dispatch: (payload: Payload) => void];"],"item_id":"context_1","normalized_text":"対象は、ジェネリック型 `State` と `Payload` を持ち、`action`、`initialState`、任意の `permalink` を受け取り、現在の state と payload を受け取る dispatch 関数のタプルを返す `useFormState` の型シグネチャである。","source_roles":["user"],"source_turn_ids":["turn_000002"]}],"specificity":[{"category":"specificity","evidence_spans":["解説と例をください。"],"item_id":"specificity_1","normalized_text":"提示された `useFormState`